sort [s asc nulls-first, r asc, id asc]
└─ project (s, i, id, r)
   └─ project (x.s, x.i, x.id, x.r)
      └─ filter (< w_0 3)
         └─ window partition=[big.s] order=[big.i desc] fns=[w_0=rank]
            └─ filter (< __topk_0__ 3)
               └─ window partial partition=[big.s] order=[big.i desc] fns=[__topk_0__=rank]
                  └─ source big AS big (rows≈400 cost≈12.8K)
